{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25907","headline":"和宗人尚书嗣复祠祭武侯毕题临淮公旧碑 · 杨汝士","name":"和宗人尚书嗣复祠祭武侯毕题临淮公旧碑","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"古栢森然地，修严蜀相祠。\n一过荣异代，三顾盛当时。\n功德流何远，馨香荐未衰。\n敬名探国志，饰像慰甿思。\n昔谒从征盖，今闻拥信旗。\n固宜光宠下，有泪刻前碑。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨汝士","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25907.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25907","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}